DTSTART:20261017T100000
DTEND:20261018T220000
UID:fce20d76465ffd29400852dc91cc179c@arts.duke.edu
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Duke Arts Presents\n\nAaron Pang walks with a cane\
 , and everyone asks “what happened?” He’s tired of answering and so 
 he wrote a solo show to tell it in one go. One accident\, two stories: one
  you’ve heard a thousand times\, one you’ve never heard before.
LOCATION:Duke University\, Durham\, NC
URL:https://arts.duke.edu/events/falling-a-disabled-love-story/
